# NOTE: Do NOT ignore remix-admin/ here.
#
# This .vercelignore is read by EVERY Vercel project that builds from this repo,
# including the remix-admin project itself (Root Directory: remix-admin). Ignoring
# `remix-admin/` here stripped that project's own source at build time, so its
# /admin routes 404'd.
#
# The Circular (root) build is already prevented from typechecking remix-admin by
# tsconfig.json ("exclude": ["node_modules", "remix-admin"]), and Next only builds
# the root app/ directory — so remix-admin/ being present is harmless to Circular.
